  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc2/). VERDICT: STALE-FIXED. 2026-11-01 review on dev 100b6fbb6e: sub/conf/routes, x/y/conf/routes and root-Scala variants all emit the route marker under hypergumbo survey (play-routes files_analyzed=1, silence_reason None). Fixed by e0bd0ecdf8 (INV-kalaj, FileIndex matches directory-segment patterns like rglob). Residual: test_stable_id_floor_gate.py _NO_FIXTURE['play-routes'] still gives 'reads only the root conf/routes' as its reason, which is no longer true. MECHANISM: FileIndex fnmatched the bare filename so directory-segment patterns (*/conf/routes) never matched under the pipeline. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: INV-kalaj. PROPOSED DISPOSITION: close (awaiting owner authorization; status unchanged)."  # 7465
